---
// "Naman" bent into an arch around the top strap of the watch (homepage). Inspired by the
// Kaytranada site header on the mood board.
// The letters are Bagel Fat One (SIL Open Font License) outlines, warped
// between two curves. Their tops sit on a shallow arch over the watch; their
// feet sit on a curve that hugs the end of the strap, so the middle letters are
// short and the outer ones stretch down either side of the strap. Each stem sweeps outwards near the
// top and then falls straight, so the end letters bend sideways and the
// middle ones only slightly, with a gentle wobble for a melted look.
// Coordinates are in the watch image's own space (0 to 1000 across the
// .watch-body box), so the arch scales with the watch.
// variant "logo" draws the same lettering at nav size (top left of every
// page except the homepage), so the brand matches the homepage arch.
interface Props { variant?: "watch" | "logo" }
const { variant = "watch" } = Astro.props;
